  "brain_first": "“先画人物情绪线，再判断这个空属于哪一段情绪。”",
  "sort_order": 1047,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2018
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "记叙类完形常围绕困难→帮助/尝试→解决→情绪",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2019
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "变化。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2020
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2021
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "情节逻辑关注人物为什么行动、情绪如何因事件改",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2022
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "变。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2023
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先画人物情绪线，再判断这个空属于哪一段情绪。”",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2024
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 多个近义词的正确选择常由情节阶段决定。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2025
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2026
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 写人物当前目标。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2027
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 标出困难/转折/结果。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2028
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 用简单箭头写情绪：worried → hopeful → relieved。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2029
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 把每个动作放在这条线里检查。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2030
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2031
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2032
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2033
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 收到坏消息后通常不直接“relieved”",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2034
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 问题解决后仍“terrified”需有额外证据",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2035
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 感谢通常出现在得到帮助之后",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2036
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 动作和情绪顺序符合故事因果。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2037
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个选项都能翻译成“高兴”时，看哪个更符合触发原因和程度。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2038
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2039
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "角色找不到钱包→焦虑；陌生人归还→惊讶；确认东西齐全→relieved；向对方→grateful。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2040
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2041
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 情绪词只看中文。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2042
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略时间顺序。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2043
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2044
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 前一事件会自然导致这个情绪吗？",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2045
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 后续反应匹配吗？",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2046
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2047
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2048
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2049
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 完形画一条“事件-情绪线”。",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2050
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2052
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. worried→help arrives→?",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2053
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 人物突然无原因大笑合理吗？",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2054
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 故事空要问的核心问题？",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2055
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 结尾情绪应与事件变化匹配吗？",
      "sourcePage": 73,
      "sourceIndex": 2056
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 完形第一遍每空必须解决吗？",
      "sourcePage": 74,
      "sourceIndex": 2057
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. relieved/hopeful；2. 通常不合理，需事件触发。；3. 为什么人物此时会这样做/想。；4. 应。；5. 不",
      "sourcePage": 74,
      "sourceIndex": 2058
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "必。",
      "sourcePage": 74,
      "sourceIndex": 2059
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— C7 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“C7”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 74,
      "sourceIndex": 2060
    }
  ],
